  "fields": {
    "title": "Generic Template Design",
    "textContent": {
      "nodeType": "document",
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Description",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Generic Templates are predesigned, readymade websites that describe the layout of a page in terms of content and visual appearance, but provide placeholders for the content to be displayed. These placeholders can be filled with the user's own content. Their appearance can usually only be adapted to a limited extent by means of a few predefined parameters. Generic template design describes the design of websites that look as if they were created using such templates, but actually are not. ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Background",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "The term was coined by web designer ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "uri": "https://maximiliankiepe.de/"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "Maximilian Kiepe",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ", Co-Founder of ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "uri": "https://liebermannkiepereddemann.de/"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "Liebermann Kiepe Reddemann",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ", and his text ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "uri": "https://event.preventdefault.net/"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "event.preventDeault();",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ". Kiepe claims that most public websites today can be categorised as belonging to this aesthetic. He identifies eight aspects as reasons for the prevalence of this visuality:",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "ordered-list",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "the focus on ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "target": {
                          "sys": {
                            "id": "6UzOyP2ueyoyoD8IMtYciu",
                            "type": "Link",
                            "linkType": "Entry"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "usability",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " and the resulting steady search engine optimisation",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "the use of web templates, which often happens in an unreflective way and without any concrete reference of the visuality to the content of the page",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "the use of frontend ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "target": {
                          "sys": {
                            "id": "6JvYGsB3Z0POfT9EnP867B",
                            "type": "Link",
                            "linkType": "Entry"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "frameworks",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": ", such as Bootstrap or Tailwind, shapes the design, and in consequence websites build on top of these frameworks naturally behave and look identical",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "the complexity of technology: Templates and ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "target": {
                          "sys": {
                            "id": "6JvYGsB3Z0POfT9EnP867B",
                            "type": "Link",
                            "linkType": "Entry"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "frameworks",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " are often used because the possibilities and technologies of web programming have become more complex in recent years and the gap between web design and web programming has widened. In most companies today, web designers have little to do with the development of a website and therefore often do not know what is technically possible, which means that they often repeat in their designs what they have already seen on other websites.",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "the misunderstanding of technology and code as a tool for production rather than a way of creative expression",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "the complexity of the design and development disciplines: ",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
                      "data": {
                        "target": {
                          "sys": {
                            "id": "2RmvRuimRiyYsVEo5kIhx0",
                            "type": "Link",
                            "linkType": "Entry"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "nodeType": "text",
                          "value": "Webdesign",
                          "marks": [],
                          "data": {}
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": " today is split into various disciplines, like user experience and interaction design, graphic and user interface design, frontend and backend development etc.",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "the striving for efficiency and the associated belief that only an efficient product can make the world simpler and better",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "list-item",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "paragraph",
                  "data": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "the fact that large companies today have a strong influence on the visuality of the web through their omnipresence. They further promote the spread of their corporate identity by making their design systems publicly accessible and usable, such as Google with its MaterialDesign design language",
                      "marks": [],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "In general, Generic Template Design not only results in a homogeneous (and interchangeable) web landscape, but in many cases also strengthens the power of the dominant large web companies. Not only Kiepe, but also other web designers such as João Ribeiro, Laurel Schwulst and Yehwan Song therefore plead for a critical approach to templates and ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "6JvYGsB3Z0POfT9EnP867B",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "frameworks",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ". They call on individuals to actively and consciously shape the visuality of the web and thus consciously oppose the increasing centralisation of the web through social media platforms.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "blockquote",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "paragraph",
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "»The web is called the\r web because its vitality depends on just that – an interconnected web \rof individual nodes breathing life into a vast network. This web needs to\r actually work for people instead of being powered by a small handful of\r big corporations – like Facebook/Instagram, Twitter, and Google« ",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                },
                {
                  "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
                  "data": {
                    "target": {
                      "sys": {
                        "id": "iQusVdNdw0eflkiXZvoHn",
                        "type": "Link",
                        "linkType": "Entry"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "nodeType": "text",
                      "value": "[1]",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "superscript"
                        }
                      ],
                      "data": {}
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Movements that intentionally stand up against this template-driven visuality are for example ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "7g0kqpwVqPkAYh7KpHl2Dd",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "Handmade Web",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " or ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "7aP7WpcrLnybp7ybP2w5Cf",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "Brutalist Webdesign",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": ".",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
